# This project uses two separate .env files, one per app:
#
#   client/.env   — copy from client/.env.example
#                   (VITE_APP_API_BASE_URL, VITE_USE_MOCK_API)
#
#   server/.env   — copy from server/.env.example
#                   (HRIS_API_BASE_URL, HRIS_API_KEY, PORT, CORS_ORIGIN, etc.)
#
# This root-level file exists only as a pointer — Vite and the Node server
# each read from their own app directory, not from the repo root.
